## Your role and start date

You will report to Jonas Becker, Engineering Manager. Your employment will begin on 1 December 2026.

## Place of work and hours

Your normal place of work will be our Munich office, with up to two days of remote work a week. Your normal working hours will be 40 hours a week.

## Salary

Your salary will be £78,000 a year gross, paid monthly by bank transfer.

| Component | Gross amount |
| Annual salary | £78,000.00 |
| Each payment (12 a year) | £6,500.00 |

## Annual bonus

You will be eligible for an annual bonus of up to 10% of your annual gross salary, based on targets agreed each year. The rules of the bonus scheme in force at the time apply.

## Probationary period

The first 6 months of your employment will be a probationary period. During this time either party may end the employment by giving one week’s notice.

## Holiday

You will receive 28 days of paid holiday in each holiday year, plus the usual public and bank holidays.

## Notice periods

After your probationary period, you must give at least one week’s notice in writing. The company will give you at least the statutory minimum notice: one week if you have worked here for less than two years, then one week for each complete year of service, up to twelve weeks.

## Pension

If you are eligible, you will be automatically enrolled into our workplace pension scheme, as the Pensions Act 2008 requires. You can choose to opt out.

## Benefits

You will also receive a monthly public transport allowance, a company pension contribution and a learning budget of €1,000 a year.

## Relocation support

To help with your move, we will provide a one-off relocation allowance of €3,000 gross.

## Written terms of employment

You will receive a written statement of your main terms of employment on or before your first day, as the Employment Rights Act 1996 requires.

## Conditions of this offer

This offer depends on:

- proof of your right to work in the UK, which we must check before you start work
- references that are satisfactory to the company

Please confirm that you accept this offer by signing and returning a copy of this letter by 30 October 2026. We look forward to welcoming you to the team.

